expectation  comet.blend-drizzled/comet-stack-stars-mono-float32-x2
operation    the stars-plus-comet blend: where the mask weighs a pixel, its position mapped back through the reference frame's star registration and forward through its comet registration, the comet stack read bilinearly there and blended by the mask, both stacks drizzled by two
input        comet-stack-stars-mono-float32-x2 description=c8a6fd2af987fd7150bd76e817f8de4299e02e8b270088d4f5c3fe3596744f32 samples=ba9b3d5c2aab18894c83d682e1f63ff0f048c46a0b7c2985246e33094288193d
class        accepted
accepted     the record divides an integer pixel position by the scale and the engine divides a half-centred one, so on drizzled stacks the comet stack is read half a pixel times one less than the scale away, and the mask moves with it
producer     AfterNightEngine reference abi=-
